  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022-25 HUM Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective of the country engagement: Improving the living conditions of Rohingya refugees and the host community in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar, Bangladesh.The long-term changes (outcomes) of the country engagement 2022-2025: 1. Rohingya refugees have access to essential services, dignified self-maintained shelters and a safe environment (GO 1).2. Host community households and Rohingya households have diversified and increased their incomes for sustainable livelihoods (GO 2). 3. Sustainable shelter designs have been developed and tested for safer and more dignified shelter solutions in emergencies (GO 3).</narrative>
  </description>
